WEBVTT

01:36.610 --> 01:39.910
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.060 --> 01:42.000
[Episode 14]

01:42.229 --> 01:43.710
Don't watch so many soap operas.

01:44.430 --> 01:45.990
You're already not smart.

01:46.009 --> 01:47.180
The more you watch, the dumber you get.

01:47.590 --> 01:49.350
What are you thinking about? Go to sleep!

01:50.539 --> 01:51.550
Who are you talking about?

01:51.550 --> 01:52.350
Say that again!

01:52.350 --> 01:53.310
Who are you calling dumb?

01:53.640 --> 01:55.450
-Apologize!
-Sorry. Sorry.

02:07.590 --> 02:08.460
Fenghua.

02:09.030 --> 02:09.910
I thought of

02:09.910 --> 02:11.100
a position in my future company

02:11.100 --> 02:12.160
that's perfect for you.

02:12.190 --> 02:12.870
What is it?

02:12.870 --> 02:13.520
Security guard.

02:13.830 --> 02:14.550
It's the perfect job

02:14.550 --> 02:15.430
for you.

02:15.460 --> 02:17.290
Sure, I'll keep you safe!

02:18.390 --> 02:19.230
Go get some rest.

02:19.230 --> 02:19.829
Good night.

02:19.829 --> 02:20.670
Good night.

02:44.390 --> 02:45.270
Grandma.

02:45.670 --> 02:46.430
You're back?

02:49.430 --> 02:50.950
Have you had dinner?

02:51.190 --> 02:52.310
Yes.

03:15.990 --> 03:17.120
Siyi.

03:17.670 --> 03:18.770
You must be tired.

03:19.630 --> 03:21.360
I saved some dinner for you.

03:23.190 --> 03:24.630
When will Chen Rui be discharged

03:24.630 --> 03:26.310
from the hospital?

03:26.750 --> 03:27.540
Soon.

03:29.470 --> 03:30.270
Once he's discharged,

03:30.270 --> 03:32.630
you won't have to work so hard, right?

03:35.750 --> 03:36.710
Alright.

03:37.460 --> 03:39.810
If you're tired, go to bed.

03:40.070 --> 03:41.690
I'll go put away the food.

03:43.270 --> 03:43.900
Grandma.

03:46.630 --> 03:47.630
Come here.

03:53.990 --> 03:54.870
What's wrong?

04:00.070 --> 04:01.270
I want to ask you something.

04:02.190 --> 04:04.140
How can you tell

04:04.140 --> 04:05.550
if someone likes you?

04:07.710 --> 04:08.670
I'm not asking for myself.

04:08.670 --> 04:10.000
It's for a classmate.

04:15.340 --> 04:16.560
Well, about that,

04:16.990 --> 04:18.430
you don't need to think too hard about it.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.589
If he likes you,

04:20.589 --> 04:22.890
you'll naturally know.

04:23.590 --> 04:24.630
It's like

04:24.790 --> 04:26.240
cooking rice.

04:27.830 --> 04:30.470
When the rice is ready, you can smell its aroma.

04:33.710 --> 04:35.010
What if

04:35.590 --> 04:37.430
he likes someone else at the same time?

04:39.870 --> 04:40.830
That won't happen.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.640
If he likes you,

04:44.020 --> 04:45.700
he'll only have eyes for you.

04:49.110 --> 04:50.780
Your grandpa and I

04:50.870 --> 04:52.770
fell in love at first sight.

04:53.060 --> 04:53.950
At that time,

04:53.950 --> 04:56.430
he only had eyes for me.

04:57.180 --> 04:59.510
He followed me everywhere I went.

04:59.540 --> 05:01.200
He was so clingy.

05:04.000 --> 05:05.290
In the future,

05:05.310 --> 05:08.110
you should find someone like that,

05:08.990 --> 05:10.820
someone who only has eyes for you.

05:17.510 --> 05:18.990
My little darling,

05:18.990 --> 05:20.270
you have something on your mind.

05:21.990 --> 05:23.030
I told you

05:23.070 --> 05:24.300
it's not about me.

05:24.980 --> 05:27.290
Okay. Whatever you say.

05:29.160 --> 05:31.210
I'll go put away the food.

05:43.320 --> 05:51.730
[Joint Exam]

05:51.950 --> 05:54.110
Class, I hope

05:54.110 --> 05:56.590
everyone can take today's joint exam seriously.

05:56.590 --> 05:58.330
Let's take this opportunity

05:58.550 --> 06:00.050
to find out

06:00.230 --> 06:02.650
how wide the gap between No. 1 High School and us is.

06:02.790 --> 06:04.510
Show the excellence of No. 1 High School.

06:04.790 --> 06:06.710
Let everyone know that our school

06:06.710 --> 06:08.540
can never be surpassed.

06:08.920 --> 06:11.970
You should have some pride.

06:12.350 --> 06:14.270
You can't lose too badly.

06:15.720 --> 06:17.420
Francis Bacon once said,

06:17.470 --> 06:19.580
"Histories make men wise;

06:19.610 --> 06:21.620
the mathematics, subtle."

06:22.940 --> 06:25.510
There's an old Chinese saying

06:26.330 --> 06:30.160
that goes, "Victory and defeat are both common in war."

06:30.340 --> 06:31.940
Don't be too nervous.

06:32.120 --> 06:33.450
Relax.

06:33.480 --> 06:35.040
Just do it as usual.

06:35.070 --> 06:36.820
If you ace this exam,

06:36.950 --> 06:39.020
I'll ask the principal to treat you to a meal!

06:39.159 --> 06:42.180
[Joint Exam]

06:42.260 --> 06:43.070
Xie.

06:43.110 --> 06:44.430
We usually only do retail,

06:44.480 --> 06:45.440
not wholesale.

06:45.590 --> 06:47.600
If we hadn't been friends for so many years,

06:47.909 --> 06:48.830
-I wouldn't…
-That's why I keep saying

06:48.830 --> 06:50.350
we're good buddies.

06:50.350 --> 06:51.470
Right? Good buddies.

06:51.470 --> 06:52.270
Yeah.

06:52.270 --> 06:53.030
The water…

06:53.030 --> 06:53.790
I think…

06:53.790 --> 06:54.670
Get a few more cases of it.

06:55.230 --> 06:56.040
A few more.

06:56.060 --> 06:56.590
How many cases of water?

06:56.590 --> 06:57.710
Seven or eight.

06:57.830 --> 06:58.240
Okay.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.030
Eight cases, right?

06:59.030 --> 06:59.830
Eight cases of water.

06:59.830 --> 07:00.670
The bread…

07:00.670 --> 07:01.510
Which brand is good?

07:02.030 --> 07:02.590
This one.

07:03.030 --> 07:03.670
It's new.

07:03.790 --> 07:04.430
Trust me.

07:04.550 --> 07:05.210
Really?

07:05.460 --> 07:06.600
Yes. It sells very well.

07:06.750 --> 07:07.950
Lao'er, take six boxes of them.

07:08.150 --> 07:09.030
Six boxes.

07:09.030 --> 07:09.950
Okay. Six boxes.

07:10.030 --> 07:10.560
Six boxes of bread.

07:10.560 --> 07:11.030
Yeah.

07:11.030 --> 07:11.790
Okay.

07:13.030 --> 07:14.120
This kind of thing doesn't sell well.

07:14.340 --> 07:15.530
Don't buy so many.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.500
Back when we were seafaring,

07:17.940 --> 07:20.050
bottled water and bread

07:20.070 --> 07:21.420
were necessities.

07:21.910 --> 07:22.710
Do as I say.

07:22.790 --> 07:24.150
Supermarkets on land

07:24.150 --> 07:26.150
are pretty much the same as those on water.

07:26.260 --> 07:27.020
Understand?

07:27.060 --> 07:28.420
My judgment should be pretty accurate.

07:28.440 --> 07:29.570
Xie.

07:29.790 --> 07:31.470
I just got this vinegar

07:31.470 --> 07:32.240
and soy sauce.

07:32.240 --> 07:33.030
They're new products.

07:33.030 --> 07:33.790
New products?

07:33.790 --> 07:34.740
Take a look.

07:34.909 --> 07:36.030
Seafarers often cook

07:36.070 --> 07:36.640
on ships.

07:36.670 --> 07:37.909
Yeah. Look.

07:38.080 --> 07:38.820
Soy sauce.

07:38.990 --> 07:40.030
How many boxes now?

07:40.030 --> 07:40.790
Five.

07:40.830 --> 07:41.630
Is it expensive?

07:41.670 --> 07:42.310
Hold it.

07:42.360 --> 07:43.540
No. It sells well.

07:43.790 --> 07:44.810
It sells well?

07:45.110 --> 07:45.909
Six boxes.

07:45.909 --> 07:46.590
Alright.

07:49.110 --> 07:50.300
Sir, we'll take the check.

07:51.020 --> 07:52.180
Boss Xie, there's no more room.

07:52.220 --> 07:52.820
The cart is full.

08:01.980 --> 08:03.700
Here! Here!

08:03.720 --> 08:04.480
Come here!

08:06.860 --> 08:07.970
What would you like?

08:08.020 --> 08:08.830
Instant noodles.

08:08.710 --> 08:15.780
[Floating Supermarket]

08:10.230 --> 08:10.710
Well,

08:10.710 --> 08:11.350
they're right here.

08:11.670 --> 08:12.710
Instant noodles.

08:13.070 --> 08:13.830
Here.

08:13.830 --> 08:14.470
Catch.

08:14.470 --> 08:15.350
One, two.

08:17.540 --> 08:18.150
Anything else?

08:18.150 --> 08:18.790
Boss Xie?

08:19.340 --> 08:20.430
Xie Tiancheng?

08:20.120 --> 08:25.070
[Floating Supermarket]

08:22.690 --> 08:23.410
Yes, it's me.

08:23.540 --> 08:25.230
You're still in the shipping business?

08:25.230 --> 08:26.110
What else can I do?

08:26.110 --> 08:27.610
It's the only thing I know in my life.

08:28.430 --> 08:29.810
Why are you selling things?

08:30.130 --> 08:31.660
It was Xia Lao'er's idea.

08:32.380 --> 08:33.159
Just for fun.

08:34.150 --> 08:36.049
Is this supermarket profitable?

08:36.350 --> 08:38.020
This ship isn't big anyway.

08:38.020 --> 08:39.580
So even if we lose money, it won't be much.

08:39.799 --> 08:40.659
Do you want anything else?

08:40.659 --> 08:42.400
Alright, give me a case of milk.

08:42.909 --> 08:43.740
Sure. Here you go.

08:45.350 --> 08:47.140
And some greens and eggplants.

08:47.310 --> 08:48.170
Here they are.

08:48.660 --> 08:49.460
Two bags.

08:49.670 --> 08:50.270
They're fresh.

08:50.270 --> 08:50.990
Fresh, right?

08:52.370 --> 08:53.220
Catch.

08:53.590 --> 08:54.710
Boss Xie?

08:54.710 --> 08:55.670
Hey.

08:55.670 --> 08:57.310
Hello, Boss Xie.

08:57.810 --> 09:00.340
How come you're selling goods now?

09:00.710 --> 09:02.990
In the old days,

09:03.060 --> 09:05.080
you'd have to shake a rattle drum.

09:05.270 --> 09:06.030
While selling,

09:06.030 --> 09:07.230
you should shout…

09:07.230 --> 09:08.670
Shut up if you're gonna be rude!

09:08.670 --> 09:11.040
It's alright. Take this laundry detergent.

09:11.040 --> 09:11.870
No, no, no.

09:11.870 --> 09:13.310
Thank you, Boss Xie.

09:13.520 --> 09:14.640
Look at you.

09:14.650 --> 09:15.590
How much is it?

09:15.590 --> 09:16.670
60 will do.

09:16.910 --> 09:17.830
Alright.

09:17.870 --> 09:18.800
60.

09:19.590 --> 09:20.380
Here.

09:20.680 --> 09:21.470
Got it.

09:21.510 --> 09:22.660
We're leaving, Boss Xie.

09:22.690 --> 09:23.790
Take care.

09:27.230 --> 09:28.010
Boss Xie.

09:28.740 --> 09:31.240
They got those things at wholesale prices?

09:31.260 --> 09:33.390
We can't make much money this way.

09:34.650 --> 09:37.090
This is customer cultivation, you know?

09:37.120 --> 09:39.770
It's not like they won't buy from us again.

09:40.620 --> 09:41.670
But…

09:43.750 --> 09:44.860
Say what you want to say.

09:43.990 --> 09:47.490
[Floating Supermarket]

09:46.790 --> 09:48.100
I don't mean to judge.

09:48.100 --> 09:49.030
I'm just saying that

09:49.060 --> 09:50.390
if you keep selling things like this,

09:50.850 --> 09:52.820
when you charge them the original price in the future,

09:52.820 --> 09:53.910
they'll all complain it's too expensive.

09:54.530 --> 09:55.640
Impossible.

09:55.660 --> 09:57.300
Lao'er, listen to me.

09:57.330 --> 09:58.270
Don't just

09:58.270 --> 10:00.020
focus on loose change.

10:00.050 --> 10:01.230
Think big, okay?

10:01.230 --> 10:02.230
Look at the bigger picture.

10:02.610 --> 10:03.680
The bigger picture.

10:03.710 --> 10:04.660
Come on, pack up.

10:04.660 --> 10:05.670
We're leaving.

10:05.750 --> 10:06.410
Come on.

10:12.270 --> 10:14.320
You're back. Come and eat.

10:14.800 --> 10:15.630
I'm not hungry.

10:16.160 --> 10:17.790
It's so late. How can you not be hungry?

10:18.030 --> 10:18.970
You go ahead and eat.

10:28.310 --> 10:29.280
What's wrong?

10:31.190 --> 10:32.190
Did you have a fight with Xie?

10:33.070 --> 10:33.710
No.

10:34.420 --> 10:35.970
If you don't tell me, I'll ask Haihong.

10:36.450 --> 10:37.050
Come back!

10:40.700 --> 10:42.280
I really don't understand.

10:42.880 --> 10:44.720
He's an expert at seafaring,

10:44.980 --> 10:46.950
but he's never run a supermarket before.

10:47.700 --> 10:49.060
He has no experience at all.

10:49.080 --> 10:51.440
Can't he think carefully before making decisions?

10:52.330 --> 10:53.290
What did he do?

10:54.310 --> 10:55.220
You have no idea.

10:55.580 --> 10:57.580
When buying goods, he didn't care if they would sell or not.

10:57.600 --> 10:58.940
He just grabbed whatever he wanted.

10:58.970 --> 11:00.200
I said they wouldn't sell,

11:00.200 --> 11:01.630
but he insisted they would.

11:02.080 --> 11:03.520
When it comes to selling,

11:03.550 --> 11:04.470
to make himself look good,

11:04.760 --> 11:06.250
he sold at wholesale prices.

11:06.890 --> 11:08.150
After toiling the whole day,

11:08.150 --> 11:09.440
we didn't make a penny

11:09.460 --> 11:10.720
and even lost 50 yuan.

11:11.030 --> 11:12.470
That won't do.

11:12.650 --> 11:14.030
You need to talk to him about it.

11:14.030 --> 11:15.330
If you don't tell him, how will he know?

11:15.510 --> 11:16.870
It's useless to talk to him.

11:16.890 --> 11:18.040
Would he listen to me?

11:19.050 --> 11:20.670
I told him those things wouldn't sell,

11:20.670 --> 11:21.850
but he insisted they would.

11:21.890 --> 11:23.920
You know what he's like.

11:32.990 --> 11:34.070
Wait for a few more days.

11:35.430 --> 11:36.550
Give him a few days to adjust.

11:36.920 --> 11:38.000
Maybe it'll get better.

11:41.070 --> 11:41.790
It's okay.

11:42.870 --> 11:43.670
Don't worry.

11:46.130 --> 11:48.650
Mom, didn't you say we'd have mandarin fish for dinner?

11:48.670 --> 11:49.470
Where's the fish?

11:52.470 --> 11:53.350
No fish.

11:53.590 --> 11:54.620
Starting today,

11:54.670 --> 11:55.980
no meat for a month.

11:56.030 --> 11:57.910
And you won't get any allowance this month.

11:58.190 --> 11:59.460
Why not?

11:59.630 --> 12:00.910
Because you're not studying hard enough.

12:00.940 --> 12:03.300
Keep arguing, and you won't get dinner either.

12:06.070 --> 12:06.790
Mom!

12:18.320 --> 12:27.360
[Honghuai Bus Station]

12:32.520 --> 12:36.980
[Honghuai Bus Station]

12:32.930 --> 12:33.960
Ge Siwei.

12:34.070 --> 12:35.130
Is Ge Siwei's family here?

12:35.130 --> 12:36.230
Here.

12:36.260 --> 12:37.400
Nice to meet you.

12:37.550 --> 12:38.390
You're Ge Siwei's family, right?

12:38.390 --> 12:39.120
Yes.

12:40.780 --> 12:41.430
That's me, right?

12:41.430 --> 12:42.260
You're in the photo.

12:42.260 --> 12:43.140
Yes.

12:43.160 --> 12:44.910
The boy's mother

12:44.910 --> 12:45.990
is so careless.

12:45.990 --> 12:47.150
This boy is so young.

12:47.150 --> 12:48.430
She should've sent him here personally.

12:48.430 --> 12:49.430
She's too busy.

12:49.430 --> 12:50.860
Alright then, I'll leave him with you.

12:51.110 --> 12:52.670
I don't want to be here.

12:51.420 --> 12:53.470
[Ping'an Bus Company]

12:52.670 --> 12:54.390
Sir, I want to go home.

12:54.390 --> 12:55.510
Siwei, come here.

12:55.510 --> 12:55.910
Be good.

12:55.910 --> 12:56.630
Come here. Be good.

12:56.450 --> 13:01.890
[Honghuai Bus Station]

12:56.650 --> 12:57.690
Go with your grandma.

12:58.020 --> 12:58.990
Be good.

12:58.990 --> 12:59.990
Thank you.

13:00.030 --> 13:00.910
Okay. Goodbye.

13:02.510 --> 13:03.740
Siwei.

13:04.730 --> 13:06.110
Here, look.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.020
I'm your grandma.

13:09.770 --> 13:11.860
I'm Siyi's grandma.

13:12.850 --> 13:14.080
Let's go home.

13:14.740 --> 13:15.300
Okay?

13:18.510 --> 13:20.950
You didn't get that high-point question right, did you?

13:21.020 --> 13:22.450
I guess you lost a lot of points.

13:24.500 --> 13:26.340
Review it thoroughly today.

13:26.350 --> 13:28.150
I'm sure you'll do better next time.

13:28.190 --> 13:28.980
Alright.

13:28.980 --> 13:30.580
You're even more nagging than my mom.

13:31.310 --> 13:32.780
I just want the best for you.

13:33.330 --> 13:34.250
Mom, I'm home.

13:34.270 --> 13:35.070
You're back.

13:35.540 --> 13:36.310
Siyi,

13:36.390 --> 13:38.390
come over for crucian carp and tofu soup tonight.

13:38.390 --> 13:38.990
Sure.

13:39.150 --> 13:40.210
See you tonight.

13:41.510 --> 13:42.110
Come and wash your hands.

13:42.110 --> 13:43.280
Go away!

13:44.330 --> 13:45.630
Take this.

13:45.870 --> 13:46.910
Go away!

13:50.500 --> 13:51.680
Grandma!

13:52.260 --> 13:53.570
Grandma, are you alright?

13:57.190 --> 13:57.950
Siyi.

13:58.030 --> 13:58.870
Siyi, you…

13:58.950 --> 14:00.450
Grandma, are you okay?

14:00.540 --> 14:01.400
I'm fine.

14:03.160 --> 14:04.190
He's your brother.

14:04.190 --> 14:05.140
What are you doing?

14:05.140 --> 14:06.310
Listen!

14:06.310 --> 14:07.150
She's my grandma,

14:07.150 --> 14:07.780
not yours!

14:07.780 --> 14:09.070
Your grandma is in Wenzhou!

14:09.070 --> 14:10.950
I don't care how they spoiled you at your home.

14:10.950 --> 14:11.790
But if you don't behave here,

14:11.790 --> 14:13.070
I'll beat you up!

14:13.070 --> 14:15.870
If you beat me, I'll tell my mom!

14:16.570 --> 14:17.380
Go ahead!

14:17.400 --> 14:18.110
Go ahead!

14:18.270 --> 14:18.870
Siyi.

14:18.870 --> 14:19.390
Go ahead!

14:19.670 --> 14:20.270
Siyi.

14:20.270 --> 14:21.430
Why did you come here?

14:21.430 --> 14:23.670
Siyi, how could you?

14:24.150 --> 14:25.230
Siyi!

14:26.030 --> 14:28.310
Siyi, he's your brother!

14:28.970 --> 14:30.600
I have no mother or brother!

14:30.670 --> 14:32.070
The only family I have in this life

14:32.070 --> 14:33.200
is Grandma!

14:34.070 --> 14:36.080
Open the door.

14:37.510 --> 14:38.430
Open the door!

14:40.870 --> 14:42.540
Open the door!

14:46.910 --> 14:47.620
Siyi.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.070
Listen to me.

14:49.070 --> 14:49.790
Be a good girl.

14:49.870 --> 14:50.790
Listen to me.

14:50.790 --> 14:51.880
Open the door.

14:51.910 --> 14:53.190
Open the door.

14:53.670 --> 14:54.860
He's your brother.

14:54.910 --> 14:56.790
Open the door, Siyi!

14:58.800 --> 14:59.430
Open the door.

14:59.430 --> 15:01.660
Open the door.

15:12.750 --> 15:13.820
Come, Siwei.

15:13.900 --> 15:15.150
Come.

15:15.270 --> 15:16.590
Let me help you up.

15:16.590 --> 15:18.190
Stop crying. Come on.

15:18.190 --> 15:19.140
Be good. Come on.

15:19.360 --> 15:20.780
Get up, get up.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.880
Come on, get up.

15:23.350 --> 15:24.960
Grandma.

15:46.430 --> 15:48.560
Naughty kids need to be spanked.

15:48.900 --> 15:50.270
After being taught a lesson,

15:50.270 --> 15:51.270
he'll behave better in the future.

15:52.020 --> 15:53.260
If I were you,

15:53.440 --> 15:54.790
I'd have kicked him.

15:58.900 --> 16:01.040
He's the one getting beaten. Why are you crying?

16:01.310 --> 16:02.390
Are your hands hurting from hitting him?

16:05.000 --> 16:06.180
My heart hurts.

16:10.840 --> 16:12.600
I feel sorry for my younger self.

16:16.100 --> 16:17.680
I was also only ten years old then.

16:18.750 --> 16:20.060
My mom kicked me out,

16:20.950 --> 16:22.050
like a bag of trash.

16:24.430 --> 16:25.390
Don't cry.

16:25.510 --> 16:26.810
This hoodie is clean.

16:26.960 --> 16:28.840
You'd end up getting snot all over me again.

16:29.550 --> 16:30.750
I won't cry.

16:38.030 --> 16:39.150
Actually,

16:39.900 --> 16:41.170
you should thank your mom.

16:44.950 --> 16:45.900
She didn't want you

16:45.900 --> 16:46.970
and sent you here,

16:47.700 --> 16:49.240
or you wouldn't have met me,

16:49.390 --> 16:51.310
Wanghe, Xingchi, and Haikuo.

16:51.310 --> 16:52.670
We're all your family.

16:53.400 --> 16:54.450
If you had stayed with her,

16:54.750 --> 16:56.070
you might have become depressed already.

16:59.910 --> 17:00.540
Yeah.

17:02.180 --> 17:03.750
Without you guys,

17:04.030 --> 17:05.630
I don't know what I would have become.

17:07.430 --> 17:08.900
You'd be miserable,

17:08.930 --> 17:10.300
wallowing in self-pity all day

17:10.300 --> 17:11.480
and washing your face with tears.

17:11.750 --> 17:12.750
You'd get tuberculosis

17:12.790 --> 17:14.839
and cough your lungs out at everyone.

17:20.079 --> 17:21.400
What about you?

17:22.290 --> 17:24.359
What if your mom abandoned you?

17:26.550 --> 17:27.270
She'd never do that.

17:28.369 --> 17:29.430
I mean, if she did.

17:30.850 --> 17:32.720
We're different.

17:33.430 --> 17:34.460
If I were you,

17:34.490 --> 17:37.580
I'd scream and yell and roll on the ground.

17:38.130 --> 17:39.880
I'd follow her around every day,

17:39.910 --> 17:41.720
holding up a banner and making tearful protests.

17:42.190 --> 17:43.550
So no one dares to abandon me.

17:43.780 --> 17:44.770
The price is too high.

17:47.150 --> 17:49.050
You're such a soft touch.

17:49.430 --> 17:50.470
When you get hurt,

17:50.470 --> 17:52.050
you just cry secretly under the covers

17:52.740 --> 17:54.400
and even try to blame yourself.

17:55.700 --> 17:57.780
"Have I not behaved well enough

17:58.030 --> 17:59.670
and disappointed Mom?"

18:01.190 --> 18:03.030
This is not right. You can't think like that.

18:05.770 --> 18:06.740
I know it's not right,

18:08.680 --> 18:09.920
but I can't change myself.

18:12.240 --> 18:13.360
Today,

18:13.580 --> 18:15.500
when I heard my brother crying outside the door,

18:16.870 --> 18:18.290
at that moment, I actually felt

18:18.320 --> 18:19.360
great.

18:21.810 --> 18:22.880
It was like…

18:23.630 --> 18:24.780
I was gloating.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.980
Back then, it was because of

18:30.240 --> 18:31.000
my brother

18:31.160 --> 18:32.480
that my mom abandoned me.

18:33.150 --> 18:34.560
Now he's in the same situation as I was.

18:36.960 --> 18:37.630
I thought to myself,

18:38.400 --> 18:39.640
"Now it's your turn."

18:44.440 --> 18:45.910
But when I saw him

18:45.910 --> 18:47.430
sitting on the ground crying,

18:49.030 --> 18:50.460
I felt so sorry for him.

18:53.500 --> 18:55.350
Because we're the same,

18:56.440 --> 18:58.110
both thrown out like trash.

19:00.760 --> 19:01.550
In the future,

19:01.590 --> 19:03.860
he and I will have to rely on each other.

19:09.640 --> 19:12.010
If you're going to rely on anyone, it should be me,

19:12.340 --> 19:13.500
not that little brat.

19:13.870 --> 19:14.720
He doesn't deserve it.

19:37.510 --> 19:38.830
Well, that…

19:38.830 --> 19:40.380
What color did you use?

19:41.390 --> 19:43.530
A red sun.

19:44.410 --> 19:45.690
He really stays?

19:51.240 --> 19:52.330
What's your name?

19:53.260 --> 19:53.900
Come here.

19:57.750 --> 19:58.510
Fenghua.

19:59.050 --> 20:00.020
How much did your grandma

20:00.040 --> 20:01.360
pay for the boy last time?

20:01.460 --> 20:02.270
Ask her about it.

20:02.300 --> 20:03.220
Tell her we have a boy here.

20:03.240 --> 20:04.090
Ask if she'll buy him.

20:04.150 --> 20:05.470
Shut up.

20:06.080 --> 20:07.080
Stop laughing.

20:07.630 --> 20:09.150
Come. These are all bad boys.

20:09.170 --> 20:10.400
Don't let them influence you.

20:10.430 --> 20:11.100
Sit here.

20:11.760 --> 20:12.320
Come on.

20:13.770 --> 20:14.710
You'll give him a ride.

20:16.450 --> 20:17.540
Don't let him fall, okay?

20:19.370 --> 20:20.390
Hurry up.

20:20.410 --> 20:21.150
We're running late.

20:25.850 --> 20:27.660
Xingchi, ride steadily.

20:37.650 --> 20:38.800
Siwei.

20:38.830 --> 20:40.670
Learn from us.

20:40.690 --> 20:42.660
We can teach you a lot of fun things.

20:42.950 --> 20:44.620
Don't listen to their nonsense.

20:51.560 --> 20:52.460
Go ahead.

20:58.080 --> 20:58.910
Slow down.

21:00.520 --> 21:02.530
Here we are.

21:00.960 --> 21:04.690
[Flower Street Elementary School of Honghuai City]

21:07.040 --> 21:07.600
Come.

21:12.810 --> 21:14.400
Wait for me here after school.

21:14.400 --> 21:15.350
I'll pick you up.

21:15.350 --> 21:16.950
I don't need you to pick me up.

21:17.340 --> 21:19.020
Fine, then go home by yourself.

21:19.040 --> 21:20.460
Don't blame me if you get lost.

21:20.630 --> 21:21.800
Go in.

21:23.250 --> 21:24.030
Go.

21:25.460 --> 21:26.520
Chop, chop.

21:27.200 --> 21:28.090
Hello.

21:29.090 --> 21:30.060
How come

21:30.080 --> 21:31.830
you two don't look alike at all?

21:31.830 --> 21:33.150
Are you sure he's your brother?

21:33.150 --> 21:34.060
You fool!

21:34.060 --> 21:35.150
Their fathers are different.

21:35.150 --> 21:36.470
Look at the way he acts.

21:36.520 --> 21:37.710
He clearly takes after his father.

21:38.440 --> 21:40.090
Sons take after their mothers.

21:40.120 --> 21:41.920
Let's go. We're running late.

21:41.980 --> 21:42.350
Let's go.

21:42.350 --> 21:43.100
Good morning.

21:45.080 --> 21:45.870
Morning.

21:59.900 --> 22:03.180
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

22:02.520 --> 22:03.310
Class,

22:03.380 --> 22:06.760
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

22:05.030 --> 22:06.560
the results of the joint exam are out.

22:08.960 --> 22:10.250
In this joint exam,

22:10.770 --> 22:12.290
Class 2, Grade 12 at No. 1 High School

22:12.310 --> 22:14.150
had the highest average science score

22:14.180 --> 22:15.210
in Honghuai.

22:17.040 --> 22:17.870
Sir,

22:17.870 --> 22:19.150
that's not surprising at all.

22:19.150 --> 22:20.970
They're a bunch of learning machines,

22:20.990 --> 22:22.360
not humans!

22:21.240 --> 22:25.460
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

22:24.310 --> 22:25.380
You guys

22:25.950 --> 22:27.570
rank fourth in Honghuai.

22:30.120 --> 22:33.320
And your average score is only

22:33.780 --> 22:35.180
23 points behind theirs.

22:37.290 --> 22:39.180
This is like

22:39.210 --> 22:41.420
an amateur boxer

22:39.260 --> 22:43.910
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

22:41.520 --> 22:42.460
♫Running with all my might♫

22:42.370 --> 22:43.970
facing Tyson in a match.

22:43.330 --> 22:45.480
♫I don't care about what others say♫

22:44.120 --> 22:47.250
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

22:44.670 --> 22:45.750
He finished the fight

22:46.170 --> 22:47.160
and lost all his teeth,

22:46.660 --> 22:47.760
♫My blood is burning hot♫

22:47.510 --> 22:48.950
but he was still standing!

22:48.920 --> 22:50.940
♫I won't let myself fall♫

22:51.420 --> 22:52.420
Moreover,

22:52.580 --> 22:55.240
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

22:52.910 --> 22:53.950
this time,

22:53.700 --> 22:55.240
♫Time gently chases on♫

22:53.990 --> 22:56.850
you got the highest score in the history of No. 7 High School!

22:55.920 --> 22:57.850
♫I'll never regret♫

22:56.920 --> 22:58.160
Congratulations, guys!

22:57.920 --> 22:59.510
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

22:58.160 --> 22:59.950
Great!

22:58.760 --> 23:00.590
♫Our prideful youth♫

23:01.520 --> 23:03.280
♫Nothing else mattered♫

23:04.300 --> 23:05.870
♫Let the world chase us slowly♫

23:06.620 --> 23:08.510
♫I'll never regret♫

23:09.150 --> 23:10.070
Class,

23:09.450 --> 23:11.480
♫The pride among the stars♫

23:10.070 --> 23:11.480
I promised you

23:11.600 --> 23:13.150
if you aced the exam,

23:12.500 --> 23:15.070
♫Keep running♫

23:13.220 --> 23:14.950
I'd have the principal treat you to a meal,

23:14.950 --> 23:15.630
right?

23:16.380 --> 23:17.810
I wasn't kidding.

23:16.930 --> 23:19.870
♫Keep running♫

23:17.910 --> 23:19.580
After school today,

23:19.750 --> 23:21.020
we'll meet at By the Canal!

23:35.640 --> 23:37.180
♫Running with all my might♫

23:37.390 --> 23:38.950
It's out! It's out!

23:38.350 --> 23:39.770
♫I don't care about the sneers♫

23:39.110 --> 23:39.990
What's out?

23:39.990 --> 23:41.350
The results of the joint exam.

23:41.060 --> 23:42.880
♫My blood is burning hot♫

23:41.500 --> 23:42.270
Look.

23:42.300 --> 23:43.580
This is my class's.

23:43.580 --> 23:45.700
♫I won't let myself fall♫

23:45.830 --> 23:47.310
And this is No. 1 High School's.

23:46.870 --> 23:49.030
♫I don't want endless nagging and chatter♫

23:50.000 --> 23:51.600
♫Words that make no sense♫

23:52.380 --> 23:54.460
♫Head up, I race forward with a roar♫

23:55.010 --> 23:57.580
♫Facing all those staring eyes♫

23:58.770 --> 24:01.980
♫Years from now♫

24:01.100 --> 24:02.390
Awesome.

24:02.550 --> 24:05.020
♫Time will prove it all♫

24:05.230 --> 24:06.640
Awesome.

24:05.590 --> 24:10.920
♫Everything gained and lost♫

24:12.410 --> 24:13.990
♫Time quietly flies by♫

24:14.810 --> 24:16.760
♫I'll never regret♫

24:15.710 --> 24:16.630
Come on.

24:17.960 --> 24:19.920
♫The pride among the stars♫

24:20.760 --> 24:24.040
♫Keep running♫

24:21.540 --> 24:21.990
Alright.

24:21.990 --> 24:23.120
Uncle Zhou,

24:23.240 --> 24:24.990
your cooking is different today.

24:25.010 --> 24:25.990
How?

24:25.210 --> 24:27.750
♫Blood burning hot♫

24:26.030 --> 24:27.420
It's completely different, not the usual taste.

24:27.550 --> 24:28.310
How does it taste today?

24:28.310 --> 24:29.200
It tastes happy.

24:29.510 --> 24:31.890
♫Blood burning hot♫

24:29.910 --> 24:31.120
You brat!

24:31.160 --> 24:33.070
You know what happiness tastes like?

24:33.620 --> 24:34.420
Xie Wanghe.

24:34.550 --> 24:35.460
Sir.

24:37.190 --> 24:39.720
The idea of the test prep center was yours, wasn't it?

24:40.030 --> 24:40.770
Yes.

24:41.310 --> 24:42.950
I know when the school

24:42.950 --> 24:44.540
used your idea,

24:44.540 --> 24:45.550
you were a bit upset.

24:45.550 --> 24:46.510
No, no, no.

24:46.510 --> 24:47.590
Not at all.

24:47.590 --> 24:49.110
I know you did it for our good.

24:49.110 --> 24:50.230
Let me finish.

24:51.550 --> 24:53.110
At that time, No. 7 High School

24:53.430 --> 24:55.630
had been under pressure from other schools for many years.

24:56.310 --> 24:57.590
We felt ashamed.

24:58.510 --> 25:00.390
As teachers of the school,

25:00.390 --> 25:01.400
we were bitter inside.

25:01.710 --> 25:03.270
So I sincerely hope

25:03.680 --> 25:05.440
you can understand our feelings.

25:05.630 --> 25:06.270
Of course.

25:06.270 --> 25:07.700
We totally understand.

25:07.700 --> 25:07.950
Yes.

25:07.950 --> 25:08.390
Right?

25:08.390 --> 25:09.550
Yes.

25:09.550 --> 25:10.430
Thank you.

25:10.870 --> 25:13.670
Thank you for your hard work, teachers.

25:14.110 --> 25:17.730
[Security Post]

25:20.070 --> 25:22.110
Goodbye.

25:22.130 --> 25:23.790
Goodbye.

25:23.790 --> 25:24.670
Wait a moment.

25:24.670 --> 25:25.470
Okay.

25:25.470 --> 25:25.990
Say goodbye to your teacher.

25:25.990 --> 25:26.830
Goodbye.

25:26.830 --> 25:27.430
Goodbye.

25:30.950 --> 25:31.950
Have all the students left?

25:31.950 --> 25:33.580
Yes, all the students have left.

25:38.510 --> 25:39.430
Ge Siwei.

25:41.120 --> 25:42.590
Ge Siwei, come out!

25:42.590 --> 25:43.910
How dare you skip school?

25:46.550 --> 25:47.470
Ge Siwei.

25:48.430 --> 25:50.510
Come out. Where are you hiding?

25:56.350 --> 25:57.930
Siyi, what's wrong?

25:57.970 --> 25:59.010
Where's Siwei?

25:59.110 --> 26:00.190
He hasn't come back.

26:00.210 --> 26:01.270
I bought some meat

26:01.270 --> 26:02.710
to make shredded pork with green peppers for you two.

26:02.710 --> 26:04.830
He didn't go to school at all today.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.350
Go look for him.

26:06.370 --> 26:07.130
Okay.

26:09.470 --> 26:10.070
That boy…

26:10.070 --> 26:10.750
Siwei.

26:12.790 --> 26:14.150
Slow down!

26:15.420 --> 26:16.470
Siyi, perfect timing.

26:16.470 --> 26:17.470
Let's go eat.

26:17.470 --> 26:18.970
I can't. I need to look for my brother.

26:19.000 --> 26:19.910
What happened?

26:19.990 --> 26:21.230
When I went to pick him up today,

26:21.230 --> 26:22.990
his teacher told me he didn't even show up at school.

26:22.990 --> 26:23.870
He's not at home either.

26:24.030 --> 26:25.470
Skipping school on the first day?

26:25.470 --> 26:26.450
Impressive.

26:26.480 --> 26:28.110
Where could he be if he's not at home?

26:28.130 --> 26:28.890
Wherever he wants.

26:28.920 --> 26:30.560
It'd be better if he died and never came back.

26:31.430 --> 26:34.010
At his age, if he ran into child traffickers…

26:35.940 --> 26:37.040
That can't be.

26:37.280 --> 26:38.120
Don't you remember?

26:38.150 --> 26:40.070
My grandma spent a lot of money to get that kid.

26:40.100 --> 26:41.810
Your brother could be sold for even more.

26:41.840 --> 26:42.480
Don't…

26:42.500 --> 26:43.460
Don't scare her.

26:43.710 --> 26:44.650
It's okay.

26:44.670 --> 26:46.230
He's been missing for less than 72 hours.

26:46.340 --> 26:47.170
We can find him.

26:47.200 --> 26:48.200
Report to the police first. Let's go.

26:48.240 --> 26:48.830
Let's go.

26:57.300 --> 26:59.100
Don't worry too much. We'll find him.

26:59.130 --> 27:00.600
There are cameras everywhere now.

27:02.810 --> 27:04.000
It's okay, Siyi.

27:04.270 --> 27:05.630
Even if he was kidnapped by human traffickers,

27:05.630 --> 27:06.630
we could still find him.

27:08.330 --> 27:09.610
What if he was in a car accident?

27:11.180 --> 27:12.910
You might as well say he was attacked by wolves.

27:15.330 --> 27:17.510
I'll sew your mouth shut sooner or later.

27:18.980 --> 27:19.710
Siyi,

27:20.490 --> 27:21.150
are you hungry?

27:21.150 --> 27:22.470
Do you want something to eat?

27:30.490 --> 27:31.130
Here he comes.

27:35.320 --> 27:36.740
Here. Take a look at the photo.

27:38.230 --> 27:39.600
Is this your brother?

27:42.950 --> 27:44.550
Yes, that's him.

27:44.830 --> 27:46.060
According to the surveillance footage,

27:46.090 --> 27:47.850
he left school early in the morning.

27:48.040 --> 27:49.280
He went to the long-distance bus station

27:49.430 --> 27:52.000
and got on a bus with the license plate ending in 8732.

27:52.030 --> 27:53.720
The destination is Suqian.

27:54.380 --> 27:55.370
Suqian?

27:57.580 --> 27:58.700
He went home.

27:59.440 --> 28:00.650
It's my mother's home.

28:27.230 --> 28:28.070
Officer,

28:28.110 --> 28:30.030
how long until we reach Suqian?

28:30.630 --> 28:33.010
It'll probably take about another half hour.

28:33.300 --> 28:34.750
Can we go faster?

28:34.760 --> 28:36.000
There's a speed limit on the national highway.

28:37.000 --> 28:38.320
Even a police car can't exceed the speed limit?

28:38.350 --> 28:39.870
Can't you shut up?

28:46.060 --> 28:48.080
[Police]

29:04.100 --> 29:05.100
Ge Siwei!

29:05.750 --> 29:06.550
Siyi.

29:10.790 --> 29:12.390
Why did you hit me?

29:12.390 --> 29:13.870
I'll fight you to the end!

29:15.030 --> 29:15.990
This is her family business.

29:15.990 --> 29:17.310
Let her handle it herself.

29:17.310 --> 29:19.290
Why are you hitting me?

29:20.320 --> 29:21.810
What were you thinking?

29:21.850 --> 29:23.420
What if you got lost?

29:29.030 --> 29:30.080
It hurts!

29:35.210 --> 29:38.260
I want Mom!

29:42.750 --> 29:44.660
Mom!

29:44.680 --> 29:46.190
You don't even have the keys?

29:46.770 --> 29:48.550
The lock has been changed.

29:49.650 --> 29:51.590
This house has probably been sold already.

29:52.010 --> 29:53.930
This isn't your home anymore!

29:56.110 --> 29:58.780
I want Mom!

29:59.710 --> 30:01.330
Mom!

30:03.510 --> 30:05.500
I don't have a home.

30:09.230 --> 30:11.010
I don't have a home.

30:11.160 --> 30:13.290
Mom.

30:14.950 --> 30:17.780
I want Mom.

30:18.760 --> 30:21.410
I want Mom.

30:23.840 --> 30:25.600
Mom.

31:00.530 --> 31:01.560
Are you full?

31:03.110 --> 31:04.650
Let's go home.

31:05.010 --> 31:06.120
No.

31:06.230 --> 31:07.820
I want to find my mom.

31:28.670 --> 31:30.420
Actually, you've impressed me.

31:31.150 --> 31:33.020
I was just like you back then,

31:33.040 --> 31:34.240
dumped at Grandma's house.

31:35.440 --> 31:37.000
I thought about running away

31:37.030 --> 31:38.230
and going back to Mom too,

31:39.560 --> 31:41.180
but I only dared to think about it.

31:41.370 --> 31:42.800
I never took action.

31:42.830 --> 31:44.270
You're braver than me.

31:45.740 --> 31:46.880
I take after my dad.

31:47.270 --> 31:48.550
My dad dares to do anything.

31:48.580 --> 31:49.900
Is that why he ended up in jail?

31:56.890 --> 31:57.940
Back then,

31:58.370 --> 31:59.850
I hated my mom very much.

32:01.030 --> 32:02.300
I always wondered

32:02.430 --> 32:03.670
why she abandoned her daughter

32:03.670 --> 32:04.670
after having a son.

32:06.590 --> 32:07.620
But then

32:07.630 --> 32:08.840
she abandoned you too.

32:09.040 --> 32:10.510
I felt instantly better.

32:10.510 --> 32:11.990
My mom didn't abandon me!

32:11.990 --> 32:13.080
Why are you yelling?

32:13.110 --> 32:15.070
Do you think yelling can make her show up?

32:15.940 --> 32:19.660
[Perfect Taste]

32:23.480 --> 32:24.830
When you're a bit older,

32:24.830 --> 32:25.790
you'll understand.

32:26.040 --> 32:27.480
Mom

32:27.510 --> 32:28.790
only loves herself.

32:31.020 --> 32:32.990
But the best thing she ever did

32:33.760 --> 32:35.750
was send me to live with Grandma.

32:36.260 --> 32:37.460
What do you mean?

32:41.300 --> 32:42.470
That yard

32:43.950 --> 32:45.030
is warm.

32:45.690 --> 32:47.240
I didn't feel warm there.

32:47.920 --> 32:49.480
I mean warm inside.

32:50.420 --> 32:52.230
You'll understand after living there for a while.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.350
No matter

32:56.370 --> 32:58.850
how bitter or upset you feel,

32:59.780 --> 33:01.260
there will be people by your side,

33:01.300 --> 33:02.250
loving you

33:02.510 --> 33:03.280
and caring for you.

33:04.070 --> 33:06.770
When you're happy, they're happy.

33:06.790 --> 33:07.790
When you're sad,

33:07.820 --> 33:09.900
they'll do everything to cheer you up,

33:09.920 --> 33:11.610
staying up late at night to keep you company.

33:12.830 --> 33:15.190
Even if you had an iceberg in your heart,

33:15.600 --> 33:16.920
they could make it melt away.

33:28.060 --> 33:29.950
They're your friends,

33:29.980 --> 33:31.550
not mine.

33:31.700 --> 33:33.290
You have friends like them,

33:33.310 --> 33:34.270
but I don't.

33:50.750 --> 33:53.110
What's mine will be yours too.

33:54.780 --> 33:56.360
But the condition is,

33:56.620 --> 33:57.940
you have to treat me as your sister.

33:59.030 --> 34:00.680
You don't just call me your sister;

34:00.700 --> 34:01.690
you accept me as one.

34:01.970 --> 34:03.100
Can you do that?

34:06.150 --> 34:07.830
If you can,

34:08.070 --> 34:09.870
I'll treat you as my brother too.

34:10.330 --> 34:11.250
A real one.

34:12.380 --> 34:13.960
I am your real brother.

34:15.040 --> 34:15.650
So you know that, huh?

34:15.670 --> 34:16.429
It hurts.

34:17.630 --> 34:19.190
I pinched you too hard?

34:23.340 --> 34:24.560
I promise

34:24.580 --> 34:26.020
I'll never hit you again.

34:26.929 --> 34:27.780
Pinky swear.

34:29.100 --> 34:30.340
Pinky swear.

34:30.380 --> 34:33.440
Pinky swear. We'll never, ever break this promise.

34:37.770 --> 34:39.090
Can we go home now?

34:40.690 --> 34:41.690
Let's go.

34:56.850 --> 34:58.810
You went easy on him today.

34:58.830 --> 35:00.200
If he were my brother,

35:00.230 --> 35:02.090
I'd have beaten him so hard that he couldn't get out of bed.

35:03.310 --> 35:05.670
He's also your brother now.

35:11.600 --> 35:12.570
Fine.

35:14.110 --> 35:15.670
If you don't behave, I'll beat you to a pulp.

35:15.690 --> 35:17.580
Be gentle. He's sleeping.

35:34.800 --> 35:35.750
Grandma, you're still up?

35:35.750 --> 35:37.030
Yeah. You found him?

35:37.060 --> 35:38.510
What happened? He fell asleep?

35:39.020 --> 35:40.800
Where did he go?

35:40.800 --> 35:41.680
He went to find his mom.

35:41.710 --> 35:43.270
That was a long journey.

35:44.190 --> 35:45.820
Here, put him here.

35:46.600 --> 35:47.030
Take off his shoes.

35:48.800 --> 35:50.350
Naughty boy.

35:51.650 --> 35:52.370
Alright.

35:55.270 --> 35:56.490
Wanghe.

35:56.520 --> 35:57.600
We'll be going.

35:57.620 --> 35:58.350
Fenghua.

35:59.000 --> 36:00.040
You must be hungry.

36:00.080 --> 36:00.960
I have some food here.

36:00.980 --> 36:02.130
Sit down and eat something. Come.

36:02.190 --> 36:03.470
It's okay, Grandma. He's not hungry.

36:03.470 --> 36:04.550
We'll be going.

36:04.550 --> 36:05.710
Get some rest.

36:05.910 --> 36:06.750
Thank you.

36:06.750 --> 36:07.630
See them out.

36:07.710 --> 36:08.710
Sorry.

36:08.770 --> 36:10.450
I caused you trouble today.

36:10.480 --> 36:11.680
That's all?

36:12.510 --> 36:13.660
You'll buy me breakfast tomorrow.

36:13.750 --> 36:15.590
I want two extra tea eggs.

36:16.470 --> 36:17.190
Okay.

36:17.190 --> 36:18.110
Go get some rest.

36:29.910 --> 36:31.610
He's so naughty.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.790
He really

36:34.830 --> 36:36.390
scared me to death.

36:37.050 --> 36:39.100
He's so bold.

36:37.470 --> 36:39.610
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

36:39.800 --> 36:41.320
Just like you when you were little.

36:40.520 --> 36:42.280
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

36:42.690 --> 36:45.420
♫Who is still by your side?♫

36:47.270 --> 36:51.000
♫As time passes♫

36:51.900 --> 36:55.680
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

36:58.860 --> 37:00.190
Siyi.

36:59.120 --> 37:02.670
♫When youthful company fades, leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

37:01.360 --> 37:02.710
Why are you awake?

37:03.230 --> 37:06.750
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

37:03.250 --> 37:04.620
I'm scared.

37:06.100 --> 37:07.130
What are you scared of?

37:07.150 --> 37:07.840
The dark.

37:08.350 --> 37:12.400
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

37:08.990 --> 37:10.350
Then sleep with the light on.

37:10.390 --> 37:12.910
At home, I always slept with Mom.

37:13.610 --> 37:16.780
♫Dreams, sweet dreams♫

37:14.880 --> 37:16.670
Alright. Come here then.

37:21.880 --> 37:24.900
♫Life is long♫

37:23.190 --> 37:24.560
Don't toss and turn too much.

37:24.630 --> 37:25.990
I'm a light sleeper.

37:26.150 --> 37:26.820
Don't worry.

37:26.360 --> 37:29.520
♫No need to dwell♫

37:26.980 --> 37:29.250
I won't move at all the whole night.

37:30.680 --> 37:34.200
♫Like moonlight♫

37:35.510 --> 37:39.110
♫Don't forget♫

37:40.080 --> 37:43.190
♫Life is long♫

37:42.970 --> 37:44.380
Head up.

37:45.260 --> 37:48.300
♫No need to dwell♫

37:49.790 --> 37:52.980
♫Like moonlight♫

37:54.620 --> 37:58.180
♫The old times♫

37:57.970 --> 37:58.850
Siyi.

38:00.020 --> 38:01.280
What?

38:04.200 --> 38:06.970
Is that boy tonight your boyfriend?

38:09.430 --> 38:11.370
The one who carried me into the room.

38:13.430 --> 38:15.140
So you weren't asleep in the car?

38:15.240 --> 38:17.460
No. I was just too sleepy

38:17.500 --> 38:19.040
to open my eyes.

38:18.960 --> 38:20.840
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

38:19.200 --> 38:21.590
But I knew he was the one who carried me in.

38:21.610 --> 38:23.030
What's his name?

38:21.830 --> 38:23.250
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

38:23.990 --> 38:27.010
♫Who is still by your side?♫

38:24.600 --> 38:26.410
His name is Xie Wanghe.

38:26.790 --> 38:28.580
You should call him Brother Wanghe.

38:28.490 --> 38:31.960
♫As time passes♫

38:28.900 --> 38:30.820
Are you two close?

38:31.730 --> 38:33.420
Can you just go to sleep?

38:33.130 --> 38:36.670
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

38:39.850 --> 38:43.700
♫When youthful company fades, leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

38:44.390 --> 38:47.910
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

38:48.260 --> 38:49.790
Wanghe

38:49.640 --> 38:53.430
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

38:49.820 --> 38:51.060
is a really nice guy,

38:51.080 --> 38:52.480
very righteous.

38:52.560 --> 38:54.620
So you should be polite to him.

38:54.360 --> 38:58.280
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

38:54.640 --> 38:55.570
No problem.

38:55.600 --> 38:57.960
I'll just call him my brother-in-law when I see him again.

38:58.440 --> 38:59.450
What are you talking about?

39:00.000 --> 39:01.520
What's going on

39:01.550 --> 39:02.910
in that little head of yours?

39:02.850 --> 39:06.060
♫Life is long♫

39:03.070 --> 39:04.270
Mom said

39:04.300 --> 39:07.400
people don't be nice to others for no reason.

39:07.480 --> 39:10.440
♫No need to dwell♫

39:07.550 --> 39:09.120
They always want something in return.

39:11.310 --> 39:12.440
It's just her.

39:12.010 --> 39:15.300
♫Like moonlight♫

39:12.470 --> 39:13.640
She's selfish herself,

39:13.660 --> 39:15.240
so she thinks everyone else is the same.

39:16.410 --> 39:17.290
Don't worry.

39:17.030 --> 39:20.510
♫Don't forget♫

39:17.720 --> 39:20.320
Everyone in this yard is very nice.

39:20.910 --> 39:22.700
You'll see that as time goes by.

39:21.710 --> 39:24.790
♫Life is long♫

39:22.740 --> 39:23.790
Go to sleep now.

39:26.320 --> 39:29.190
♫No need to dwell♫

39:31.340 --> 39:34.580
♫Like moonlight♫

39:35.910 --> 39:39.360
♫The old times♫

39:39.140 --> 39:45.890
[Breakfast]

39:43.320 --> 39:44.230
Ge Siwei.

39:46.280 --> 39:48.440
All new students get bullied,

39:48.790 --> 39:50.800
especially skinny, little ones like you

39:50.830 --> 39:51.790
who look fragile.

39:51.810 --> 39:52.930
You're the easiest target.

39:52.960 --> 39:54.240
Don't scare him.

39:54.500 --> 39:55.540
Don't listen to his nonsense.

39:55.560 --> 39:57.080
If someone tries to beat you, tell the teacher.

39:57.110 --> 39:57.840
Siwei,

39:57.860 --> 39:58.700
it's useless.

39:58.850 --> 39:59.640
If you tell the teacher,

39:59.660 --> 40:00.480
they'll beat you up even harder afterward.

40:00.510 --> 40:01.770
A vicious cycle.

40:03.160 --> 40:04.260
Siyi.

40:05.250 --> 40:06.450
She's a girl.

40:06.460 --> 40:07.350
She's never been beaten up.

40:07.470 --> 40:09.090
You should listen to me about this.

40:09.790 --> 40:11.110
If someone beats you,

40:11.110 --> 40:12.550
don't fight back.

40:12.710 --> 40:13.840
Why?

40:14.150 --> 40:15.630
If someone hits you,

40:15.910 --> 40:17.920
just fall when they push you

40:18.230 --> 40:19.110
and then start twitching

40:19.110 --> 40:19.990
and foaming at the mouth.

40:20.300 --> 40:21.770
Can't you teach him something good?

40:21.830 --> 40:22.710
If you teach him to fake injuries at such a young age,

40:22.710 --> 40:23.790
how can he grow up to be a good man?

40:23.970 --> 40:25.500
This trick works well.

40:25.640 --> 40:27.480
I used it against Liang before.

40:27.510 --> 40:28.270
You have no idea.

40:28.290 --> 40:29.260
The boy called Liang

40:29.290 --> 40:31.970
nearly got beaten into a cripple by his dad that day.

40:33.870 --> 40:35.150
Are we clear?

40:35.700 --> 40:37.040
If someone pushes you,

40:37.200 --> 40:38.660
you roll your eyes first.

40:39.250 --> 40:40.420
How do I do that?

40:40.440 --> 40:42.910
Why don't you show me?

40:44.130 --> 40:45.170
Do it!

40:45.200 --> 40:47.970
Do it, do it, do it!

40:48.010 --> 40:50.590
Do it, do it, do it!

40:51.310 --> 40:52.710
Be quiet.

40:52.710 --> 40:54.130
You're the new kid,

40:54.400 --> 40:55.870
aren't you?

40:58.650 --> 40:59.750
Are you okay?

41:00.130 --> 41:01.230
Are you okay?

41:02.560 --> 41:03.660
Are you alright?

41:04.550 --> 41:05.970
Are you okay?

41:08.210 --> 41:09.500
Here we are.

41:09.830 --> 41:10.830
Good morning.

41:10.850 --> 41:11.970
Good morning, miss. Good morning, sir.

41:12.010 --> 41:12.810
Hey.

41:15.760 --> 41:16.840
Siyi, I'm leaving.

41:16.870 --> 41:17.550
Okay.

41:20.950 --> 41:22.350
Roll your eyes and twitch,

41:22.380 --> 41:23.260
remember?

41:25.500 --> 41:27.350
Stop. He's just a kid.

41:27.350 --> 41:28.430
What if he really tries to scam someone in the future?

41:31.390 --> 41:32.390
Brother-in-law.

41:33.810 --> 41:35.470
Be nice to my sister,

41:35.490 --> 41:37.090
or I'll beat you up.

41:40.740 --> 41:42.110
Who are you calling your brother-in-law?

41:42.260 --> 41:42.970
He's crazy.

41:43.000 --> 41:44.200
I'll have to give him a beating again tonight.

42:01.140 --> 42:02.620
Why do you think

42:03.320 --> 42:04.860
Siwei

42:05.170 --> 42:07.950
called Wanghe his brother-in-law?

42:10.240 --> 42:11.430
What's wrong?

42:14.120 --> 42:15.090
Are you jealous?

42:15.110 --> 42:17.140
Why would I be jealous?

42:17.470 --> 42:19.070
I just think it was funny.

42:21.450 --> 42:22.810
Don't worry.

42:24.780 --> 42:26.290
Xie Wanghe and Ma Siyi

42:26.320 --> 42:27.320
can't be together.

42:29.160 --> 42:29.870
Why?

42:29.910 --> 42:30.980
Wanghe said that

42:31.480 --> 42:33.270
for a man to have a successful career,

42:33.350 --> 42:36.010
he needs a helpful wife first.

42:36.030 --> 42:37.230
Given Ma Siyi's situation,

42:37.260 --> 42:38.710
it'd be good enough if she didn't hold him back.

42:41.480 --> 42:43.510
You can't say that.

42:43.560 --> 42:46.270
Why would Siyi hold him back?

42:48.180 --> 42:49.520
We're all friends.

42:49.630 --> 42:51.650
Don't make it sound like I'm speaking ill of her behind her back.

42:57.460 --> 42:58.670
You don't have a chance either.

42:59.560 --> 43:00.640
Why not?

43:02.700 --> 43:04.020
You're too silly.

43:06.340 --> 43:08.420
Shao Xingchi!
